ial_ev":3511.1,"dcf_model_ev":14050.7,"ev_to_ebitda":18,"debt_to_ebitda":9.94,"net_debt_to_ebitda":-18.42,"f_score":8,"f_score_breakdown":[{"id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 8.0%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $445M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 53.1%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 1.81"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":21.39,"default_fair_val":21.39,"premium_pct":-47.4,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":24,"pe_forward":21.1,"pb_trailing":1.2,"pb_forward":1.1,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":6.6,"fcf_to_ev":12.67,"fcf_to_mcap":3.8,"liab_to_assets":53.1,"cash_to_assets":60.9,"current_ratio":1.81,"roe":18,"roa":8,"moat":{"ticker":"LI","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"理想汽車的品牌定價能力在中高階電動車市場展現出一定的優勢，主要得益於其專注於家庭用戶需求的產品定位和創新的增程式電動技術。相較於傳統汽車品牌轉型緩慢，以及部分新勢力在技術路線上的搖擺，理想汽車的清晰戰略使其在目標客群中建立了較強的品牌忠誠度。然而，面對比亞迪等價格競爭激烈的對手，以及特斯拉等國際品牌的技術壓力，其定價權仍有提升空間。品牌溢價的建立需要持續的產品創新和服務優化，以鞏固其在市場中的獨特地位。","comment_en":"Li Auto's brand pricing power shows some advantage in the premium electric vehicle market, mainly due to its product positioning focused on family user needs and innovative extended-range electric technology. Compared to the slow transition of traditional auto brands and the wavering technical routes of some emerging players, Li Auto's clear strategy has built strong brand loyalty among its target customer base. However, facing intense price competition from rivals like BYD and technological pressure from international brands like Tesla, its pricing power still has room for improvement. Building brand premium requires continuous product innovation and service optimization to solidify its unique market position."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"理想汽車在電動車技術，特別是增程式電動技術（EREV）方面擁有核心專利，這構成了其早期發展的重要壁壘。然而，汽車產業的專利壁壘相對較低，且技術迭代迅速，尤其是在純電動領域。監管政策的變化，如補貼退坡、雙積分政策等，對所有電動車企業都構成影響，理想汽車亦不例外。雖然公司在專利佈局上有所投入，但相較於長期深耕的傳統汽車巨頭和在電池、智能化領域擁有大量專利的科技公司，其專利護城河尚不夠寬廣，且易受技術變革和政策調整的影響。","comment_en":"Li Auto holds core patents in electric vehicle technology, particularly in Extended-Range Electric Vehicle (EREV) technology, which formed a significant barrier in its early development. However, patent barriers in the automotive industry are relatively low, and technological iteration is rapid, especially in the pure electric domain. Changes in regulatory policies, such as subsidy reductions and dual-credit policies, affect all EV companies, including Li Auto. While the company invests in patent deployment, its patent moat is not yet wide enough compared to established traditional auto giants and tech companies with numerous patents in battery and intelligent systems. It is also susceptible to technological shifts and policy adjustments."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"理想汽車透過其創新的產品設計和用戶生態系統，在一定程度上建立了客戶轉換成本。其專注於家庭用戶的車型，如 L 系列 SUV，提供了寬敞的空間、冰箱、娛樂系統等，這些配置對於家庭用戶具有較高的吸引力。一旦用戶習慣了理想汽車的生態系統，包括車載系統、充電網絡的便利性以及售後服務，更換到其他品牌的成本（包括時間、金錢和習慣的改變）會相對較高。然而，電動車市場的快速發展和新技術的湧現，使得用戶對新技術的接受度提高，轉換成本的黏性有待加強。","comment_en":"Li Auto has, to some extent, established customer switching costs through its innovative product design and user ecosystem. Its models, focusing on family users like the L-series SUVs, offer spacious interiors, refrigerators, entertainment systems, etc., which are highly attractive to families. Once users become accustomed to Li Auto's ecosystem, including the convenience of its in-car system, charging network, and after-sales service, the cost of switching to another brand (including time, money, and changes in habit) is relatively high. However, the rapid development of the EV market and the emergence of new technologies increase user acceptance of new technologies, and the stickiness of switching costs needs further strengthening."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"理想汽車的網絡效應尚不明顯。雖然公司透過其直營銷售和服務網絡，以及不斷擴張的充電樁佈局，試圖建立用戶之間的聯繫和便利性，但這更多體現為規模優勢而非典型的網絡效應。真正的網絡效應是指用戶越多，產品或服務的價值就越大，例如社交媒體或共享出行平台。在汽車行業，尤其是在品牌忠誠度較高的情況下，網絡效應的體現較為緩慢。理想汽車的用戶社群活躍度較高，但尚未形成強大的、能自我強化的網絡效應壁壘。","comment_en":"Li Auto's network effects are not yet significant. Although the company attempts to build connections and convenience among users through its direct sales and service network, and its expanding charging infrastructure, this primarily reflects economies of scale rather than typical network effects. True network effects occur when the value of a product or service increases with the number of users, like social media or ride-sharing platforms. In the automotive industry, especially with high brand loyalty, network effects manifest more slowly. While Li Auto's user community is active, it has not yet formed a strong, self-reinforcing network effect barrier."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"理想汽車憑藉其在中國電動車市場的快速成長，已經建立起一定的規模經濟優勢。隨著產量的增加，其在採購、生產和研發方面的單位成本有望下降。公司積極佈局供應鏈，並透過標準化生產流程來提升效率。相較於小型新創公司，理想汽車的規模使其在與供應商談判時具有更強的議價能力，並能分攤固定成本。然而，與全球領先的汽車製造商，特別是擁有龐大燃油車生產基礎的傳統巨頭相比，其規模優勢仍有提升空間，尤其是在全球化佈局和成熟供應鏈管理方面。","comment_en":"Li Auto has established certain economies of scale through its rapid growth in the Chinese electric vehicle market. As production volume increases, its per-unit costs in procurement, manufacturing, and R&D are expected to decrease. The company is actively developing its supply chain and improving efficiency through standardized production processes. Compared to smaller startups, Li Auto's scale gives it stronger bargaining power with suppliers and allows for better allocation of fixed costs. However, compared to global leading automakers, especially traditional giants with vast internal combustion engine production bases, its scale advantage still has room for improvement, particularly in global expansion and mature supply chain management."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"理想汽車的獨特地理資產主要體現在其對中國市場的深度理解和佈局。公司專注於中國家庭用戶的需求，並在此基礎上開發產品和服務，這使其在本土市場具有顯著的競爭優勢。其在中國的生產基地和銷售網絡，以及對當地消費者偏好的精準把握，構成了其獨特的地理優勢。然而，這種優勢的複製性相對較低，且在面對全球化競爭時，其地理上的集中性也可能成為一種限制。若要將此優勢擴展至海外市場，則需要克服文化、法規和市場習慣的差異。","comment_en":"Li Auto's unique geographical assets are primarily reflected in its deep understanding and strategic positioning within the Chinese market. The company focuses on the needs of Chinese family users, developing products and services based on this insight, which gives it a significant competitive advantage in the domestic market. Its production bases and sales network in China, along with its precise grasp of local consumer preferences, constitute its unique geographical advantage. However, the replicability of this advantage is relatively low, and its geographical concentration could become a limitation when facing global competition. Expanding this advantage to overseas markets would require overcoming differences in culture, regulations, and market habits."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"理想汽車展現出卓越的營運效率，尤其是在產品開發和市場響應速度方面。公司能夠快速推出符合市場需求的新車型，並有效管理其生產和銷售流程。其直營模式有助於更好地控制客戶體驗和品牌形象，同時也簡化了分銷渠道。儘管面臨電動車行業普遍的供應鏈挑戰，理想汽車透過其精細化的管理和對關鍵零部件的戰略佈局，保持了較高的生產效率和交付能力。其F-Score為8/9，以及穩健的自由現金流（FCF TTM: $445.0M），都印證了其優異的營運管理水平。","comment_en":"Li Auto demonstrates excellent operational efficiency, particularly in product development and market responsiveness. The company can quickly launch new models that meet market demand and effectively manage its production and sales processes. Its direct sales model helps better control customer experience and brand image while simplifying distribution channels. Despite facing common supply chain challenges in the EV industry, Li Auto maintains high production efficiency and delivery capacity through its refined management and strategic positioning of key components. Its F-Score of 8/9 and robust Free Cash Flow (FCF TTM: $445.0M) attest to its superior operational management."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"理想汽車展現出相對審慎且有效的資本配置能力。公司擁有充裕的現金儲備（$12,621.3M），同時負債水平相對可控（$4,422.7M），這為其未來的發展提供了堅實的財務基礎。其高ROE（18.0%）和ROA（8.0%）顯示其資本運用效率良好。公司將資金重點投入於研發創新、產能擴張和銷售網絡建設，這些都是支持其長期成長的關鍵領域。管理層在擴張與維持財務穩健之間取得了平衡，避免了過度擴張帶來的風險，體現了巴菲特所欣賞的務實資本配置哲學。","comment_en":"Li Auto demonstrates relatively prudent and effective capital allocation capabilities. The company possesses ample cash reserves ($12,621.3M) with a controllable debt level ($4,422.7M), providing a solid financial foundation for future development. Its high ROE (18.0%) and ROA (8.0%) indicate good capital utilization efficiency. The company strategically invests funds in R&D innovation, production capacity expansion, and sales network development, all critical areas supporting its long-term growth. Management strikes a balance between expansion and maintaining financial stability, avoiding risks associated with over-expansion, reflecting the pragmatic capital allocation philosophy admired by Buffett."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"理想汽車透過其專注於家庭用戶的產品策略和不斷優化的用戶體驗，成功建立了較高的客戶留存率。其車輛的舒適性、智能化配置以及完善的售後服務體系，都增強了用戶的滿意度和忠誠度。公司積極構建用戶社群，鼓勵用戶分享體驗，進一步鞏固了品牌與用戶之間的聯繫。增程式電動技術的獨特性也使得用戶在習慣其駕駛和補能模式後，轉換到其他技術路線的意願降低。雖然市場競爭激烈，但理想汽車在維護客戶關係方面表現出色。","comment_en":"Li Auto has successfully established a relatively high customer retention rate through its product strategy focused on family users and continuously optimized user experience. The comfort, intelligent features, and comprehensive after-sales service system of its vehicles enhance user satisfaction and loyalty. The company actively builds user communities, encouraging users to share their experiences, further strengthening the bond between the brand and its customers. The uniqueness of its extended-range electric technology also reduces users' willingness to switch to other technological routes once they become accustomed to its driving and refueling modes. Despite fierce market competition, Li Auto excels in maintaining customer relationships."},"m10_durability":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"理想汽車的長期可持續性面臨多重考量。一方面，其在中國電動車市場的快速成長和清晰的產品定位提供了發展動力。另一方面，汽車行業正經歷劇烈變革，技術快速迭代（如固態電池、更高級別的自動駕駛），以及來自國內外眾多競爭對手的壓力，都對其長期競爭格局構成挑戰。雖然增程式技術在過渡期內具有優勢，但未來純電動技術的發展趨勢不明朗。此外，全球宏觀經濟波動、地緣政治風險以及潛在的監管變化，都可能影響其長期穩定性。其護城河的持久性有待市場和時間的驗證。","comment_en":"Li Auto's long-term sustainability faces multiple considerations. On one hand, its rapid growth in the Chinese EV market and clear product positioning provide development momentum. On the other hand, the automotive industry is undergoing drastic changes, with rapid technological iteration (e.g., solid-state batteries, higher-level autonomous driving) and pressure from numerous domestic and international competitors posing challenges to its long-term competitive landscape. While extended-range technology offers advantages during the transition period, the future trend of pure electric technology development remains uncertain. Furthermore, global macroeconomic fluctuations, geopolitical risks, and potential regulatory changes could impact its long-term stability. The durability of its moat remains to be validated by the market and time."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"理想汽車憑藉其對中國家庭用戶需求的精準把握，在電動車市場建立起獨特的品牌定位和一定的客戶忠誠度。其增程式電動技術在過渡期內提供了差異化優勢，加上卓越的營運效率和相對穩健的資本配置，使其在競爭激烈的市場中脫穎而出。然而，汽車行業技術變革迅速，專利壁壘和網絡效應相對薄弱，且其地理優勢的全球複製性有限。理想汽車的護城河更偏向於一種「收費橋」模式，透過提供差異化產品和服務來吸引並留住客戶，但其持久性仍需觀察其能否持續創新以應對技術顛覆和日益加劇的市場競爭。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Li Auto has carved out a unique brand position and cultivated a degree of customer loyalty in the EV market by accurately understanding the needs of Chinese family users. Its extended-range electric technology provides a differentiated advantage during the transition period, coupled with excellent operational efficiency and relatively sound capital allocation, allowing it to stand out in a fiercely competitive market. However, the automotive industry is characterized by rapid technological change, with relatively weak patent barriers and network effects, and its geographical advantage has limited global replicability. Li Auto's moat leans more towards a 'toll bridge' model, attracting and retaining customers by offering differentiated products and services. However, its durability hinges on its ability to continuously innovate to counter technological disruption and intensifying market competition.","evidenceHash":"ceda78e09bbfdfc6b882ccca247a9cf9ffcf4502985dfec0977cf7be83a6b4a8","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"CNY","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:24:37.317Z","evidenceHash":"822a4e77edd5dc40d15b0e036dcc4ea4ad586ab7ac9c7bc16472f66735b7cb47"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"CNY","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:24:37.317Z","evidenceHash":"822a4e77edd5dc40d15b0e036dcc4ea4ad586ab7ac9c7bc16472f66735b7cb47"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/LI.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/LI.png","website":"https://www.lixiang.com","ceo":"Xiang Li","full_time_employees":"27048","description":"Li Auto Inc. is a prominent player in the rapidly expanding new energy vehicle market within the People's Republic of China. The company's operations span the entire lifecycle of high-end intelligent electric vehicles, from their initial design and development to manufacturing and eventual sale. Its diverse product portfolio primarily consists of multi-purpose vehicles (MPVs) and sport utility vehicles (SUVs). The company engages directly with customers through a blend of digital platforms and traditional brick-and-mortar channels, providing comprehensive sales and post-purchase management services. Originally founded in 2015 as Leading Ideal Inc., the company officially adopted its current name, Li Auto Inc., in July 2020. Its corporate headquarters are situated in Beijing, China.","description_en":"Li Auto Inc. is a prominent player in the rapidly expanding new energy vehicle market within the People's Republic of China. The company's operations span the entire lifecycle of high-end intelligent electric vehicles, from their initial design and development to manufacturing and eventual sale. Its diverse product portfolio primarily consists of multi-purpose vehicles (MPVs) and sport utility vehicles (SUVs). The company engages directly with customers through a blend of digital platforms and traditional brick-and-mortar channels, providing comprehensive sales and post-purchase management services. Originally founded in 2015 as Leading Ideal Inc., the company officially adopted its current name, Li Auto Inc., in July 2020. Its corporate headquarters are situated in Beijing, China.","description_zh":"Li Auto Inc.（美股代碼：LI）為 Consumer Cyclical 領域之重要企業，專注於 Auto - Manufacturers 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"11 Wenliang Street","city":"Beijing","state":"BE","zip":"101399","country":"CN","phone":"86 10 8742 7209","full_address":"11 Wenliang Street, Beijing, BE 101399, CN","range_52w":"10.66-21.5","year_high":21.5,"year_low":10.66,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":10.66,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-06-17","name":"Ma Donghui","title":"director, officer: President","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":7500000,"price":14.38,"total_val":107.85},{"date":"2026-0